00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:13.180
When I look at the components
of Anthos and how it fits,

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:16.480
this is how I like to
mentally think about it.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:19.810
The first box on the bottom,
you have Anthos Migrate.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:22.660
And you can bring new
applications to Anthos,

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.520
