00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:41.470
The next part, I have my app.

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:42.690
I want to run it somewhere.

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:43.460
Where do I run it?

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.252
And this is where we
give you some options.

00:08:48.402 --> 00:08:50.610
This is where we try to give
you some options, again,

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:54.240
between GKE on the cloud,
between Anthos GKE deployed

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:57.660
on BareMetal, and between
Anthos GKE deployed on some

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.310
of the other cloud providers.

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:02.128
So the next part is, I've
got all of these clusters.

00:09:02.128 --> 00:09:03.420
I want to manage them together.

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:04.350
What do I do?

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.000
And this is where
