You've got running,
got the best practices,

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:51.240
you've got access to
Container services on GCP.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:52.767
Again, easy upgrade path.

00:11:52.767 --> 00:11:55.350
A lot of the capabilities that
